{"author": "blazaropinto", "body": "Hi Pascale,\n\nThanks for this. I updated this term for [GO:0034080](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0034080) in IPR012485. For IPR018464 I removed this term but I am not sure if adding [GO:0007059](https://www.ebi.ac.uk/QuickGO/term/GO:0007059) would be right for all members, what do you think?\n\nBest,\nBeatriz", "created_at": "2025-07-10T08:33:21Z", "key": "comment:3056324132", "type": "comment", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T08:33:21Z"}
{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Hi @blazaropinto \nIt seems to be [GO:0051382 kinetochore assembly](https://amigo.geneontology.org/amigo/term/GO:0051382#display-lineage-tab) would be the best term? \n\nhttps://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/Q9BU64/entry\n\nWhat do you think ? ", "created_at": "2025-07-10T08:36:41Z", "key": "comment:3056336824", "type": "comment", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T08:36:41Z"}
